+# Wire
+
+## codex-api/src/
+
+`codex-api/src/api_bridge.rs` — maps API/transport failures into `CodexErr` for overload, policy, quota, usage-limit, timeout, connection, request-id, and identity-auth cases (`codex-api/src/api_bridge.rs:21`).
+`codex-api/src/api_bridge_tests.rs` — tests error mapping for retry delays, Cloudflare blocks, policy errors, usage limits, rate-limit headers, and identity-auth headers (`codex-api/src/api_bridge_tests.rs:7`).
+`codex-api/src/auth.rs` — defines `AuthError`, async `AuthProvider` futures, shared provider alias, and auth-header telemetry (`codex-api/src/auth.rs:30`).
+`codex-api/src/common.rs` — defines shared Responses wire types for compaction, events, tools, requests, WebSocket envelopes, metadata, and streams (`codex-api/src/common.rs:275`).
+`codex-api/src/error.rs` — defines crate-wide `ApiError` variants for transport, status, stream, quota, retry, rate limit, invalid request, policy, and overload failures (`codex-api/src/error.rs:9`).
+`codex-api/src/files.rs` — uploads OpenAI hosted files, including size checks, Azure blob PUT, finalization/retry, download metadata, diagnostics, and `sediment://` URIs (`codex-api/src/files.rs:121`).
+`codex-api/src/images.rs` — serializes image generation/edit request bodies and deserializes image response/data fields (`codex-api/src/images.rs:5`).
+`codex-api/src/lib.rs` — declares crate modules and public re-exports for wire clients, auth, errors, files, images, provider, requests, search, and telemetry (`codex-api/src/lib.rs:1`).
+`codex-api/src/provider.rs` — configures provider endpoints, retry policy, Responses/Chat wire selection, HTTP/WebSocket URLs, and Azure detection (`codex-api/src/provider.rs:56`).
+`codex-api/src/rate_limits.rs` — parses rate-limit windows, credits, promo/reached types, header families, and `codex.rate_limits` events (`codex-api/src/rate_limits.rs:26`).
+`codex-api/src/safety_buffering.rs` — reads safety-buffering and faster-model headers into `SafetyBufferingTreatment` (`codex-api/src/safety_buffering.rs:8`).
+`codex-api/src/search.rs` — defines Search API request, input, command, settings, filters, and web/image/finance/weather/sports/time response structures (`codex-api/src/search.rs:14`).
+`codex-api/src/telemetry.rs` — provides SSE/WebSocket telemetry hooks and retry-aware unary/streaming HTTP telemetry (`codex-api/src/telemetry.rs:18`).
+
+## codex-api/src/endpoint/
+
+`codex-api/src/endpoint/compact.rs` — POSTs compaction input to `responses/compact`, captures turn-state, and decodes compacted `ResponseItem` output (`codex-api/src/endpoint/compact.rs:39`).
+`codex-api/src/endpoint/images.rs` — serializes image generation/edit requests, POSTs their endpoints, and decodes image responses plus request-id headers (`codex-api/src/endpoint/images.rs:58`).
+`codex-api/src/endpoint/memories.rs` — POSTs memory-trace input to `memories/trace_summarize` and decodes summarize output (`codex-api/src/endpoint/memories.rs:36`).
+`codex-api/src/endpoint/mod.rs` — declares endpoint modules and re-exports endpoint clients plus realtime wire types (`codex-api/src/endpoint/mod.rs:10`).
+`codex-api/src/endpoint/models.rs` — GETs model listings, appends client version, and decodes `ModelsResponse` with ETag (`codex-api/src/endpoint/models.rs:46`).
+`codex-api/src/endpoint/realtime_call.rs` — creates WebRTC Realtime calls with SDP/session payloads and decodes SDP plus `Location` call IDs (`codex-api/src/endpoint/realtime_call.rs:49`).
+`codex-api/src/endpoint/responses.rs` — streams Responses requests, selecting Responses or Chat wire translation and endpoint/session headers (`codex-api/src/endpoint/responses.rs:130`).
+`codex-api/src/endpoint/responses_websocket.rs` — connects and runs Responses-over-WebSocket streams, including headers, errors, timing, safety buffering, and request serialization (`codex-api/src/endpoint/responses_websocket.rs:685`).
+`codex-api/src/endpoint/search.rs` — POSTs `SearchRequest` to `alpha/search` and decodes `SearchResponse` (`codex-api/src/endpoint/search.rs:35`).
+`codex-api/src/endpoint/session.rs` — builds endpoint requests and executes them with retry telemetry, auth, and HTTP transport (`codex-api/src/endpoint/session.rs:98`).
+
+## codex-api/src/endpoint/realtime_websocket/
+
+`codex-api/src/endpoint/realtime_websocket/methods.rs` — manages realtime WebSocket streams, connections, writers, events, transcript state, URLs, and client lifecycle (`codex-api/src/endpoint/realtime_websocket/methods.rs:765`).
+`codex-api/src/endpoint/realtime_websocket/methods_common.rs` — routes realtime outbound messages and session updates by V1, FramelessBidi, or RealtimeV2 adapter (`codex-api/src/endpoint/realtime_websocket/methods_common.rs:41`).
+`codex-api/src/endpoint/realtime_websocket/methods_common_tests.rs` — tests adapter-specific session updates, context append channels, and handoff/function-output payloads (`codex-api/src/endpoint/realtime_websocket/methods_common_tests.rs:16`).
+`codex-api/src/endpoint/realtime_websocket/methods_frameless_bidi.rs` — builds frameless bidi session JSON and context-append messages with a 500-byte chunk cap (`codex-api/src/endpoint/realtime_websocket/methods_frameless_bidi.rs:11`).
+`codex-api/src/endpoint/realtime_websocket/methods_frameless_bidi_tests.rs` — tests chunk preservation and role-bearing initial items in frameless session JSON (`codex-api/src/endpoint/realtime_websocket/methods_frameless_bidi_tests.rs:11`).
+`codex-api/src/endpoint/realtime_websocket/methods_v1.rs` — encodes V1 conversation items, handoff appends, Quicksilver session updates, and intent (`codex-api/src/endpoint/realtime_websocket/methods_v1.rs:18`).
+`codex-api/src/endpoint/realtime_websocket/methods_v2.rs` — encodes RealtimeV2 session configuration, tools, modalities, output modality strings, and intent (`codex-api/src/endpoint/realtime_websocket/methods_v2.rs:30`).
+`codex-api/src/endpoint/realtime_websocket/mod.rs` — declares realtime method/protocol modules and re-exports their client, connection, writer, event, and config types (`codex-api/src/endpoint/realtime_websocket/mod.rs:2`).
+`codex-api/src/endpoint/realtime_websocket/protocol.rs` — defines realtime adapters, session modes/config, outbound messages, audio formats, and conversation payload serialization (`codex-api/src/endpoint/realtime_websocket/protocol.rs:52`).
+`codex-api/src/endpoint/realtime_websocket/protocol_common.rs` — parses realtime JSON payloads, session updates, transcript deltas/done events, and error messages (`codex-api/src/endpoint/realtime_websocket/protocol_common.rs:7`).
+`codex-api/src/endpoint/realtime_websocket/protocol_frameless_bidi.rs` — parses frameless bidi audio, transcripts, turn completion, and client delegation events (`codex-api/src/endpoint/realtime_websocket/protocol_frameless_bidi.rs:15`).
+`codex-api/src/endpoint/realtime_websocket/protocol_frameless_bidi_tests.rs` — tests legacy/frameless handoff equivalence and reuse of transcript/audio events (`codex-api/src/endpoint/realtime_websocket/protocol_frameless_bidi_tests.rs:7`).
+`codex-api/src/endpoint/realtime_websocket/protocol_v1.rs` — parses V1 realtime audio, transcripts, conversation items, handoffs, and errors (`codex-api/src/endpoint/realtime_websocket/protocol_v1.rs:12`).
+`codex-api/src/endpoint/realtime_websocket/protocol_v2.rs` — parses RealtimeV2 audio, transcripts, response lifecycle, conversation items, handoffs, and silence/noop events (`codex-api/src/endpoint/realtime_websocket/protocol_v2.rs:24`).
+
+## codex-api/src/requests/
+
+`codex-api/src/requests/chat.rs` — translates Responses requests into OpenAI-compatible Chat Completions messages, tools, outputs, reasoning, GLM clamping, and output format (`codex-api/src/requests/chat.rs:17`).
+`codex-api/src/requests/headers.rs` — builds session/thread headers and derives the subagent header from `SessionSource` (`codex-api/src/requests/headers.rs:5`).
+`codex-api/src/requests/mod.rs` — declares chat/headers/responses request modules and exports `Compression` (`codex-api/src/requests/mod.rs:1`).
+`codex-api/src/requests/responses.rs` — defines the Responses request compression enum with `None` and `Zstd` (`codex-api/src/requests/responses.rs:2`).
+
+## codex-api/src/sse/
+
+`codex-api/src/sse/chat.rs` — translates Chat Completions SSE into Responses-shaped events, accumulating text, reasoning, tool calls, finish reasons, and usage (`codex-api/src/sse/chat.rs:27`).
+`codex-api/src/sse/mod.rs` — declares chat and Responses SSE modules and exports their stream entry points (`codex-api/src/sse/mod.rs:1`).
+`codex-api/src/sse/responses.rs` — handles Responses SSE, including rate limits/model/turn-state/safety-buffering headers, event decoding, failures, idle timeout, telemetry, and completion (`codex-api/src/sse/responses.rs:36`).

