+# Wire
+
+## codex-api/src/
+
+`codex-api/src/api_bridge.rs` — maps API/transport failures into `CodexErr` for overload, policy, quota, usage-limit, timeout, connection, request-id, and identity-auth cases (`codex-api/src/api_bridge.rs:21`).
+`codex-api/src/api_bridge_tests.rs` — tests error mapping for retry delays, Cloudflare blocks, policy errors, usage limits, rate-limit headers, and identity-auth headers (`codex-api/src/api_bridge_tests.rs:7`).
+`codex-api/src/auth.rs` — defines `AuthError`, async `AuthProvider` futures, shared provider alias, and auth-header telemetry (`codex-api/src/auth.rs:30`).
+`codex-api/src/common.rs` — defines shared Responses wire types for compaction, events, tools, requests, WebSocket envelopes, metadata, and streams (`codex-api/src/common.rs:275`).
+`codex-api/src/error.rs` — defines crate-wide `ApiError` variants for transport, status, stream, quota, retry, rate limit, invalid request, policy, and overload failures (`codex-api/src/error.rs:9`).
+`codex-api/src/files.rs` — uploads OpenAI hosted files, including size checks, Azure blob PUT, finalization/retry, download metadata, diagnostics, and `sediment://` URIs (`codex-api/src/files.rs:121`).
+`codex-api/src/images.rs` — serializes image generation/edit request bodies and deserializes image response/data fields (`codex-api/src/images.rs:5`).
+`codex-api/src/lib.rs` — declares crate modules and public re-exports for wire clients, auth, errors, files, images, provider, requests, search, and telemetry (`codex-api/src/lib.rs:1`).
+`codex-api/src/provider.rs` — configures provider endpoints, retry policy, Responses/Chat wire selection, HTTP/WebSocket URLs, and Azure detection (`codex-api/src/provider.rs:56`).
+`codex-api/src/rate_limits.rs` — parses rate-limit windows, credits, promo/reached types, header families, and `codex.rate_limits` events (`codex-api/src/rate_limits.rs:26`).
+`codex-api/src/safety_buffering.rs` — reads safety-buffering and faster-model headers into `SafetyBufferingTreatment` (`codex-api/src/safety_buffering.rs:8`).
+`codex-api/src/search.rs` — defines Search API request, input, command, settings, filters, and web/image/finance/weather/sports/time response structures (`codex-api/src/search.rs:14`).
+`codex-api/src/telemetry.rs` — provides SSE/WebSocket telemetry hooks and retry-aware unary/streaming HTTP telemetry (`codex-api/src/telemetry.rs:18`).
+
+## codex-api/src/endpoint/
+
+`codex-api/src/endpoint/compact.rs` — POSTs compaction input to `responses/compact`, captures turn-state, and decodes compacted `ResponseItem` output (`codex-api/src/endpoint/compact.rs:39`).
+`codex-api/src/endpoint/images.rs` — serializes image generation/edit requests, POSTs their endpoints, and decodes image responses plus request-id headers (`codex-api/src/endpoint/images.rs:58`).
+`codex-api/src/endpoint/memories.rs` — POSTs memory-trace input to `memories/trace_summarize` and decodes summarize output (`codex-api/src/endpoint/memories.rs:36`).
+`codex-api/src/endpoint/mod.rs` — declares endpoint modules and re-exports endpoint clients plus realtime wire types (`codex-api/src/endpoint/mod.rs:10`).
+`codex-api/src/endpoint/models.rs` — GETs model listings, appends client version, and decodes `ModelsResponse` with ETag (`codex-api/src/endpoint/models.rs:46`).
+`codex-api/src/endpoint/realtime_call.rs` — creates WebRTC Realtime calls with SDP/session payloads and decodes SDP plus `Location` call IDs (`codex-api/src/endpoint/realtime_call.rs:49`).
+`codex-api/src/endpoint/responses.rs` — streams Responses requests, selecting Responses or Chat wire translation and endpoint/session headers (`codex-api/src/endpoint/responses.rs:130`).
+`codex-api/src/endpoint/responses_websocket.rs` — connects and runs Responses-over-WebSocket streams, including headers, errors, timing, safety buffering, and request serialization (`codex-api/src/endpoint/responses_websocket.rs:685`).
+`codex-api/src/endpoint/search.rs` — POSTs `SearchRequest` to `alpha/search` and decodes `SearchResponse` (`codex-api/src/endpoint/search.rs:35`).
+`codex-api/src/endpoint/session.rs` — builds endpoint requests and executes them with retry telemetry, auth, and HTTP transport (`codex-api/src/endpoint/session.rs:98`).
+
